/*
  HealthGaugeGrid.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0154 · HealthGaugeGrid (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `HealthGaugeGrid`
  resolves (table "HealthGaugeGrid") lives here with its web English value. These entries fold
  into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the
  shared catalog.

  The first group holds the keys extracted verbatim from the web source
  (features/driving/components/drivetrain-health/HealthGaugeGrid.tsx) — the canonical
  `drivetrain.*` labels. The remaining keys back the localized status names (the web capitalizes
  the enum inline) and the native-only chrome (freshness chip, connectivity banner, loading +
  empty + error + retry copy).
*/

